  hint: Found at a stone known as the Obelisk
  characterDescription: "Barn owl\r\nFound at a stone known as the Obelisk\r\nOutfit
    inspired by early 1900s archaeologists\r\nA little bit eerie, Oscar seems to
    know things before they actually happen, and has successfully guessed the lottery
    numbers every week since he was an owlet. He\u2019s best friends with Fey the
    fox, and they can often be found discussing the hidden meanings in their favourite
    books.\r"
